Plant/crane ground bearing pressure	산업안전보건기준에 관한 규칙 (Occupational Safety and Health Standards, relevant construction-machinery clauses)	BS 7121 (Code of practice for safe use of cranes) Part 1 & 11; LOLER / PUWER (UK) — referenced for methodology only	Crane manufacturer outrigger load data governs; platform must be verified for manufacturer-stated maximum outrigger reaction.
